   "backTo": "reparation",
   "alt": "A rainy-day waiting room under the glass roof, seen from high above: everyone gathers on one round rug. A girl presses her hands together beside her mended bicycle; a boy's left elbow sends a jar of buttons flying; a grandmother knits an endless scarf that coils across the rug; a grandpa fits the last piece of a jigsaw; a woman holds a bowl of dewy strawberries. A canary flies free from its open cage, a teddy lies tucked in a basket with a hot-water bottle and a thermometer, wild flowers burst from an old kettle, muddy boots stand on the floor and a little armchair is tied off with a ribbon. On the dresser at the back sits a market crate. A blue door at the far left leads back to the workshop.",
