   "alt": "The breakdown room at dusk, seen through a tall archway from a dark plank corridor, lit by one flickering bare bulb under the glass roof. A whirring fan blows a girl's hair as she taps a frozen Jell-O; a boy carries cups each on its own saucer; a boy winces at a violin with a snapped string; a girl holds up an empty picture frame; a man crawls under the table hunting for the glasses perched on his own head beside a jigsaw with one piece missing. In front, a toaster flings toast into the air, a wind-up ant topples over, a plug sits snugly in its socket, a cat sleeps on a switched-off radio and a toddler pushes a square peg at a round hole. A green door at the far left leads back to the workshop.",
